  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water to the boil. Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid, then reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from the heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and all water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-596d0f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the rice is cooking, thinly slice the apple. Cut the lime into wedges. Finely chop the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-4a9de510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine the teriyaki sauce (see ingredients), soy sauce, brown sugar and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-57167720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. Add the teriyaki glaze and garlic, stirring to combine. Cook until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-ad437a30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the slaw mix and apple. Add the coconut sweet chilli mayonnaise and toss to combine.\n• To the saucepan with the rice, stir through the crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-db199040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the peanut rice between bowls. Top with the teriyaki plant-based mince and creamy coconut-sweet chilli slaw. Serve with the lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f852560d0527cba53ae28b/step-47012a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
